---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="页面走丢了" noindex
  ><div class="container error-page">
    <div class="eyebrow">ROUTE NOT FOUND</div><span class="error-number mono"
      >404<span class="accent">_</span></span
    ><h1>探索，偶尔也会走进岔路。</h1><p>这个地址还没有对应的页面，换个方向继续看看。</p><div
      class="hero-actions"
    >
      <a class="button primary" href="/">返回首页 <Icon name="arrow" size={18} /></a><a
        class="button secondary"
        href="/projects/">浏览项目</a>
    </div>
  </div></BaseLayout
>
